@startuml 14-state-transaction-status
title Transaction status of a payment (section 14.13, increments 4 and 5)
[*] --> RCVD : POST /v1/payments/{product}
RCVD --> ACTC : authorisation finalised (and confirmation if required)
RCVD --> RJCT : SCA denied, expired, refused by risk, or validation failed
RCVD --> CANC : cancelled before authorisation
ACTC --> ACSC : executed and settled by the core banking
ACTC --> RJCT : refused by the core banking (funds, limits, blocked account)
ACTC --> CANC : cancellation authorised before execution
ACSC --> [*]
RJCT --> [*]
CANC --> [*]
note right of ACTC
  Accepted for execution.
  A cancellation is still possible
  until the core books the payment.
end note
@enduml
